<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AMC Entertainment raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AMC Entertainment raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its recommendation on AMC Entertainment Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares climbed 1-1/8 to 20-3/4 in early American Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
